# Wrath++ (docs/wrathpp/): its identity and the client sources it builds on, pinned. Resolved on
# 2026-11-10 (docs/wrathpp/SOURCE_AUDIT.md); change a pin only with a record of why and the tests
# run on the new one (docs/wrathpp/TEST_RESULTS.md).
WRATHPP_REALM_ID=5
WRATHPP_WORLD_PORT=8087
WRATHPP_PROTOCOL=1
# The source-built x64 3.3.5a client (a decompilation: no license, never vendored or redistributed
# here; NOTICE.md in its repository) and the runtime and SDK of the same ABI (0.1.46). The client's
# README links WarcraftXL/core and WarcraftXL/sdk, which are older, incompatible repositories: the
# matching pair is WarcraftXL-Labs' gitea-sync branches.
CLIENT_REPO=https://github.com/WarcraftXL-Labs/client
CLIENT_COMMIT=fdb9ad1819e68085d4cde4e33b2a17f772fcf85d
CORE_REPO=https://github.com/WarcraftXL-Labs/core
CORE_COMMIT=f7d6cdaf4393e3b89b7ccb889b295aa871d45ca9
SDK_REPO=https://github.com/WarcraftXL-Labs/sdk
SDK_COMMIT=2920b6e3143169a4244dde6e9d832cd7721f2489
